    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.completion\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHi echasnovski! Is it possible to have treesitter completion added to mini.completion something like what this plugin does for nvim-cmp [ray-x/cmp-treesitter](https://github.com/ray-x/cmp-treesitter).\r\nThis will help me use mini.completion when there is no LSP attached.\r\nBasically my request is that if LSP is attached use LSP completion other wise use treesitter completion.",
