            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "'mini.completion' has [two stage completion](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/0a8a1072137d916406507c941698a4bfa9dbbe7a/doc/mini-completion.txt#L17-L30): first try LSP and fallback to fallback source (even if LSP is attached but returned no results). You can try configuring [fallback action](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/0a8a1072137d916406507c941698a4bfa9dbbe7a/doc/mini-completion.txt#L224), but how exactly it should be done to have suggestions from tree-sitter parsing I'll leave up to you (or someone else) to figure out.",
